invariant: INV-36
file: build.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: build.zig's copy of SRCS loses rsa_mont.c, so the Zig object of every
  RSA build leaves out the Montgomery arithmetic the RSA-PSS verifier calls.
  A relocatable object links with the calls undefined, and the localizer keeps
  the same exports, so only the comparison with make print-lib-srcs objects.

--- old
    "rsa.c",                 "rsa_mont.c",         "pem.c",               "x509.c",
--- new
    "rsa.c",                 "pem.c",               "x509.c",
